(Landin's knot on the certified store rung — one `ref` cell plus an
η-expanded forwarder per binding, then backpatching `setref`s),
enclosing the five dispatch functions (`meval`, `mform`, `mapply`,
`mdata`, `mstore`) and the tag/truthiness helpers certified at table
level in `AdequacyTags.lean`. The single `callcc` is the
host-absorption site (`ADEQUACY.md` §5, risk 1).
